A 1446 @ The Hinterlands, 33.8, 75.2 | The Atal'ai Exile at Shadra'Alor. Bring the head of Jammal'an the Prophet.
A 3528 @ Tanaris, 67.0, 22.4 | Yeh'kinya in Steamwheedle Port, after The Ancient Egg. Fill the egg at the Avatar of Hakkar event inside.
A 1445 @ Swamp of Sorrows, 47.9, 54.8 | Fel'zerul in Stonard, after Return to Fel'Zerul. 20 Fetishes of Hakkar from the enemies inside.
RUN | The temple is in the lake in the middle of the Swamp of Sorrows, east of Stonard: swim down through the sunken doorway and follow the halls to the portal.
